    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείλαιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			14.1722.7
		</span></i>), lengthd. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειλός</span>
		(q.v.): —<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wretched,
				sorry, paltry,</i> not in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, freq. in Trag., esp. of persons, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				580
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείλαιε τοῦ νοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1347
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. χάρις</span> a
			<i>sorry</i> kindness, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				517
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. σποδός</span>
			<i>paltry</i> dust, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				758
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἄχεα, ἀλγηδών, δύα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				145
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				513
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1311
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					156
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): sts. found in Com. (v. infr.) and Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				24.23
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.172
			</span></i>: in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.29b
			</span></i>. (The penult. is short in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1311
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				849
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				279
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				139
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				165
			</span></i>, etc.)</div>
